{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"時事全方位｜建造業前景與工人薪酬(一)\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-10-22-12-25-25MtlfGHgY.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】題目：建造業前景與工人薪酬</p><p>建造業總工會公布新一年度薪酬調整安排，絕大部分工種都要凍薪。究竟建造業前景如何？政府可以做些甚麼幫助業界提升競爭力？</p><p>嘉賓：香港建造業總工會副理事長趙建強</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T12:51:08.003806+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":99,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T04:47:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T14:18:13.336725+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T12:46:59.357701+00:00","content_hash":"70e22ad51b72de6df9a2af06532ee5ceb5559cc6986137ff722222d5be1e9a33","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}